   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 07 \u00b7 Quick upscale (4x-UltraSharp)\n\n1. Click **choose file to upload** in *1. UPLOAD LOW-RES IMAGE*. The node shows the original.\n2. Press **Run**. It takes a few seconds.\n3. The upscaled image appears in **3. RESULT + SAVE** and is saved automatically.\n\n**Where it's saved:** your ComfyUI **output** folder, subfolder **upscale**, as `4xUltraSharp_00001_.png`, \u2026\nTo save somewhere else, edit the *filename_prefix* (e.g. `MyProject/photo`).\n\n**Final size:** 1.0 gives full 4\u00d7 (512 px \u2192 2048 px). Use 0.5 for 2\u00d7. Downscaling the 4\u00d7 result usually looks cleaner than a direct 2\u00d7 upscale.\n\n**Naturalness:** 4x-UltraSharp alone makes skin look smooth and slightly painted. Blending 25% of a plain resize back in restores natural texture (this was tested). Set it to 0 for maximum crispness, e.g. for text, logos or illustrations.\n\n**Tips:**\n- Best for photos and renders that are small but clean.\n- For very blurry or heavily compressed photos, or faces, use **01**'s SeedVR2 stage instead. It reconstructs detail rather than only sharpening.\n- License: 4x-UltraSharp is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, **non-commercial**. For commercial work use RealESRGAN_x4plus (BSD) or SeedVR2 (Apache)."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653",
   "title": "READ ME"
  }
